    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d445">

                <pb facs="0536" n="424" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg424"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 422.11G93/979</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hartman</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-21T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 21, 1918, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your October 25, 7 p.m. Are the daily deposits made in the name of the Council of
                    Foreign Bondholders? What is the amount of remittance already made to
                    London?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
